Package: mobcam
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libportaudio2
Recommends: v4l2loopback-dkms
Maintainer: Robin Kumar <rkrobin6550@gmail.com>
Description: Turn your Android phone into a webcam and microphone
 Mob Cam streams your phone's camera and microphone to this desktop over
 USB or Wi-Fi and publishes them as a real system camera and microphone
 that Zoom, Meet, Teams, OBS, and any browser can pick up
